    "segments": [
      {
        "image": "data/reel_materials/nishikori-career-farewell/00-bridge.png",
        "seconds": 6.8,
        "narration": "十八岁拿下第一座巡回赛冠军。锦织圭，把亚洲男子网球带向了更远的地方。",
        "image_kind": "photo"
      },
      {
        "speed": 1,
        "source": "raw_0",
        "start": 0,
        "end": 8.52,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "quote": [
          {
            "at": 4.91,
            "end": 6.73,
            "text": "It is a remarkable story.\n这是一段非凡的故事。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speed": 1,
        "source": "raw_0",
        "start": 48.95,
        "end": 57.35,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "quote": []
      },
      {
        "speed": 1,
        "source": "raw_0",
        "start": 79.45,
        "end": 89.01,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "quote": [
          {
            "at": 5.980000000000004,
            "end": 7.409999999999997,
            "text": "He's done it!\n他做到了！"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speed": 1,
        "source": "raw_0",
        "start": 113.82,
        "end": 117.78,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "quote": [
          {
            "at": 0.0,
            "end": 3.940000000000012,
            "text": "And he wins over Feliciano Lopez in dominant form.\n他强势击败费利西亚诺·洛佩斯。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "image": "data/reel_materials/nishikori-career-farewell/05-bridge.png",
        "seconds": 6.92,
        "narration": "东京、孟菲斯、巴塞罗那。从第一座到第十二座，每一次捧杯，都有自己的重量。",
        "image_kind": "photo"
      },
      {
        "speed": 1,
        "source": "raw_1",
        "start": 350.5,
        "end": 374.26,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "quote": [
          {
            "at": 8.34,
            "end": 13.52,
            "text": "The defending champion is out here in Madrid.\n卫冕冠军在马德里被淘汰。"
          },
          {
            "at": 13.8,
            "end": 18.94,
            "text": "Kei Nishikori scores his first ever win over Roger Federer.\n锦织圭首次击败费德勒。"
          },
          {
            "at": 18.94,
            "end": 23.74,
            "text": "Certainly his finest win on a clay court, of the Japanese player.\n这是他红土赛场最出色的胜利。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speed": 1,
        "source": "raw_0",
        "start": 151.15,
        "end": 158.63,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "quote": [
          {
            "at": 2.799999999999983,
            "end": 4.960000000000008,
            "text": "Game, set, match, Nishikori.\n局、盘、比赛，锦织圭获胜。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speed": 1,
        "source": "raw_0",
        "start": 168.4,
        "end": 170.28,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "quote": []
      },
      {
        "speed": 1,
        "source": "raw_0",
        "start": 183.15,
        "end": 194.55,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "quote": [
          {
            "at": 7.95,
            "end": 11.37,
            "text": "Nishikori makes history in Barcelona.\n锦织圭在巴塞罗那创造历史。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speed": 1,
        "source": "raw_2",
        "start": 731.5,
        "end": 758.5,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "quote": []
      },
      {
        "speed": 1,
        "source": "raw_3",
        "start": 139,
        "end": 151.52,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "quote": [],
        "narration": "费德勒、纳达尔、德约科维奇，他都赢过。美网击败德约，让他走进大满贯决赛。决赛没能夺冠，但他成为了首位，晋级大满贯男单决赛的亚洲球员。"
      },
      {
        "speed": 1,
        "source": "raw_0",
        "start": 278.85,
        "end": 287.49,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "quote": [
          {
            "at": 2.74,
            "end": 5.64,
            "text": "One hour and 47 minutes,\n1小时47分，"
          },
          {
            "at": 5.64,
            "end": 7.56,
            "text": "and we have a new champion,\n新冠军"
          },
          {
            "at": 7.56,
            "end": 8.639999999999986,
            "text": "Kei Nishikori.\n锦织圭。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speed": 1,
        "source": "raw_0",
        "start": 323.65,
        "end": 337.01,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "quote": []
      },
      {
        "speed": 1,
        "source": "raw_0",
        "start": 377.45,
        "end": 386.13,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "quote": []
      },
      {
        "speed": 1,
        "source": "raw_0",
        "start": 401,
        "end": 402.88,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "quote": []
      },
      {
        "speed": 1,
        "source": "raw_0",
        "start": 403.4,
        "end": 410.72,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "quote": [
          {
            "at": 1.6800000000000068,
            "end": 4.220000000000027,
            "text": "Victory for Nishikori!\n锦织圭获胜！"
          },
          {
            "at": 4.230000000000018,
            "end": 6.32000000000005,
            "text": "And what a way to do it!\n这样的夺冠方式，太精彩了！"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speed": 1,
        "source": "raw_4",
        "start": 548.5,
        "end": 566.86,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "quote": [
          {
            "at": 15.18,
            "end": 18.16,
            "text": "Nishikori wins Washington.\n锦织圭赢下华盛顿冠军。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speed": 1,
        "source": "raw_0",
        "start": 613.45,
        "end": 626.61,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "quote": []
      },
      {
        "speed": 1,
        "source": "raw_5",
        "start": 509,
        "end": 531,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "quote": []
      },
      {
        "image": "data/reel_materials/nishikori-career-farewell/20-bridge.png",
        "seconds": 7.88,
        "narration": "里约拿下铜牌。同年回到纽约，他再进四强。那些漫长的第五盘，他从不轻易交出去。",
        "image_kind": "photo"
      },
      {
        "speed": 1,
        "source": "raw_6",
        "start": 64.84,
        "end": 83.52,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "quote": [
          {
            "at": 0.0,
            "end": 1.4,
            "text": "And with that volley,\n凭借这记截击，"
          },
          {
            "at": 1.4,
            "end": 4.05,
            "text": "Nishikori broke at five-all in the fifth.\n决胜盘5比5，锦织圭破发。"
          },
          {
            "at": 4.74,
            "end": 5.91,
            "text": "This was match point.\n这是赛点。"
          },
          {
            "at": 7.48,
            "end": 11.05,
            "text": "And Kei Nishikori, with that going in the net,\n随着这一球下网，锦织圭"
          },
          {
            "at": 11.05,
            "end": 12.96,
            "text": "finds himself in the semifinals\n他晋级半决赛，"
          },
          {
            "at": 12.96,
            "end": 15.36,
            "text": "for the second time in three years,\n这是三年内第二次。"
          },
          {
            "at": 15.36,
            "end": 18.6,
            "text": "upsetting Andy Murray, seven-five in the fifth.\n击败安迪·穆雷，决胜盘七比五。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "image": "data/reel_materials/nishikori-career-farewell/22-bridge.png",
        "seconds": 6.56,
        "narration": "伤病让他停下，也让归来变得更难。可他还是回到年终舞台，再次击败费德勒。",
        "image_kind": "photo"
      },
      {
        "speed": 1,
        "source": "raw_7",
        "start": 44.625,
        "end": 51.585,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "quote": []
      },
      {
        "speed": 1,
        "source": "raw_0",
        "start": 822.85,
        "end": 836.57,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "quote": [
          {
            "at": 4.55,
            "end": 9.67,
            "text": "The drought is over.\n冠军荒结束了。"
          },
          {
            "at": 9.67,
            "end": 13.69,
            "text": "Two sets to one: 6-4, 3-6, 6-2.\n两盘比一：6比4、3比6、6比2。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speed": 1,
        "source": "raw_0",
        "start": 850.15,
        "end": 854.23,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "quote": []
      },
      {
        "image": "data/reel_materials/nishikori-career-farewell/26-bridge.png",
        "seconds": 6.72,
        "narration": "十二冠的最后一座在布里斯班。伤病让他走了很多弯路，却没让他放弃回到球场。",
        "image_kind": "photo"
      },
      {
        "speed": 1,
        "source": "raw_8",
        "start": 7,
        "end": 13.28,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "quote": [],
        "narration": "2026年10月1日，东京。最后一场巡回赛结束，把最后的话留给他自己。"
      },
      {
        "source": "raw_9",
        "start": 274.4,
        "end": 290.4,
        "speed": 1,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "quote": [
          {
            "at": 0.33,
            "end": 1.37,
            "text": "ケガでこうやって\n伤病让我"
          },
          {
            "at": 1.37,
            "end": 4.59,
            "text": "何年も自分が失った中で\n失去了多年的时间"
          },
          {
            "at": 5.11,
            "end": 6.29,
            "text": "最後の最後まで\n但直到最后的最后"
          },
          {
            "at": 6.81,
            "end": 8.39,
            "text": "諦めずにプレーできた\n我没有放弃，一直打球"
          },
          {
            "at": 8.39,
            "end": 9.13,
            "text": "っていうことが\n这件事"
          },
          {
            "at": 9.13,
            "end": 12.3,
            "text": "自分の誇りかなと思います\n我想，这是我的骄傲"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source": "raw_9",
        "start": 313,
        "end": 323,
        "speed": 1,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "quote": [
          {
            "at": 0.04,
            "end": 1.7,
            "text": "本当にありがとうございました\n真的非常感谢大家"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source": "raw_9",
        "start": 315,
        "end": 320,
        "speed": 1,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "visual_image": "data/reel_materials/nishikori-career-farewell/closing-card.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "editorial": {
      "mode": "match_review",
      "question": "从十八岁首冠到东京告别，锦织圭怎样用十二座冠军和一次次归来，为亚洲男子网球打开新的路？",
