        "audio_in": 0,
        "audio_out": 6.768,
        "start": 0,
        "spoken_text": "十八岁拿下第一座巡回赛冠军。锦织圭，把亚洲男子网球带向了更远的地方。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
        "author_tts": true
      },
      {
        "unit_id": "compact-02",
        "audio": "data/reel_materials/nishikori-career-farewell/audio/compact-02.mp3",
        "marks": "data/reel_materials/nishikori-career-farewell/audio/compact-02-marks.json",
        "audio_in": 0,
        "audio_out": 6.888,
        "start": 37.24,
        "spoken_text": "东京、孟菲斯、巴塞罗那。从第一座到第十二座，每一次捧杯，都有自己的重量。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
        "author_tts": true
      },
      {
        "unit_id": "compact-03",
        "audio": "data/reel_materials/nishikori-career-farewell/audio/compact-03.mp3",
        "marks": "data/reel_materials/nishikori-career-farewell/audio/compact-03-marks.json",
        "audio_in": 0,
        "audio_out": 6.84,
        "start": 115.68,
        "spoken_text": "费德勒、纳达尔、德约科维奇，他都赢过。美网击败德约，让他走进大满贯决赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
        "author_tts": true
      },
      {
        "unit_id": "compact-04",
        "audio": "data/reel_materials/nishikori-career-farewell/audio/compact-04.mp3",
        "marks": "data/reel_materials/nishikori-career-farewell/audio/compact-04-marks.json",
        "audio_in": 0,
        "audio_out": 5.448,
        "start": 122.52,
        "spoken_text": "决赛没能夺冠，但他成为了首位晋级大满贯男单决赛的亚洲球员。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
        "author_tts": true
      },
      {
        "unit_id": "compact-05",
        "audio": "data/reel_materials/nishikori-career-farewell/audio/compact-05.mp3",
        "marks": "data/reel_materials/nishikori-career-farewell/audio/compact-05-marks.json",
        "audio_in": 0,
        "audio_out": 7.872,
        "start": 221.6,
        "spoken_text": "里约拿下铜牌。同年回到纽约，他再进四强。那些漫长的第五盘，他从不轻易交出去。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
        "author_tts": true
      },
      {
        "unit_id": "compact-06",
        "audio": "data/reel_materials/nishikori-career-farewell/audio/compact-06.mp3",
        "marks": "data/reel_materials/nishikori-career-farewell/audio/compact-06-marks.json",
        "audio_in": 0,
        "audio_out": 6.528,
        "start": 248.16,
        "spoken_text": "伤病让他停下，也让归来变得更难。可他还是回到年终舞台，再次击败费德勒。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
        "author_tts": true
      },
      {
        "unit_id": "compact-07",
        "audio": "data/reel_materials/nishikori-career-farewell/audio/compact-07.mp3",
        "marks": "data/reel_materials/nishikori-career-farewell/audio/compact-07-marks.json",
        "audio_in": 0,
        "audio_out": 6.696,
        "start": 279.48,
        "spoken_text": "十二冠的最后一座在布里斯班。伤病让他走了很多弯路，却没让他放弃回到球场。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
        "author_tts": true
      },
      {
        "unit_id": "compact-08",
        "audio": "data/reel_materials/nishikori-career-farewell/audio/compact-08.mp3",
        "marks": "data/reel_materials/nishikori-career-farewell/audio/compact-08-marks.json",
        "audio_in": 0,
        "audio_out": 6.264,
        "start": 286.2,
        "spoken_text": "2026年10月1日，东京。最后一场巡回赛结束，把最后的话留给他自己。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
        "author_tts": true
      }
